//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Phil777 rune number — shown on low filter levels and in town (Phil777 keeps its own
// rune names from 03-alias-kassahi-luxe; the other Kassahi filters use 09-Runes-Kassashi-0names).
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ItemDisplay[RUNE>0 (FILTLVL<3 OR MAPID=1 OR MAPID=40 OR MAPID=75 OR MAPID=103 OR MAPID=109)]: %NAME% %GREEN%%RUNENUM%%CONTINUE%
